WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.830
Everything is made of atoms.

00:00:02.830 --> 00:00:07.400
At the centre is a tiny nucleus of protons and neutrons.

00:00:07.400 --> 00:00:10.460
Electrons don't circle it like planets.

00:00:10.460 --> 00:00:13.540
They spread around it in a fuzzy cloud.

00:00:13.540 --> 00:00:16.650
And the atom is mostly empty space:

00:00:16.650 --> 00:00:20.500
a pea-sized nucleus would sit in a stadium-sized atom.
